### Description
This RP goal is to allow you to accept Json (Map) in the request body without having to separate the json value for variables, as mentioned in this comment #350 (comment)

### Example usage
Data is a type custom Scalar Map

mutation {
    hello (
        name: "Name",
        data: { 
            param1: "Test 1",
